#: ../../../reference/interfaces/location-control-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/location-control-interface.md:8
msgid "location-control interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/location-control-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"`location-control` allows operating as the location service, providing "
"privileged access to configure, observe and use location services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/location-control-interface.md:12
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/location-control-interface.md:15
msgid ""
"The `location-control` slot is {ref}`unsupported for parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-unsupported>`. The slot owns a unique system-"
"wide resource that instances would conflict over."
msgstr ""
